# The example's one image (scripts/test-device-gateway.sh): Alpine
# with script(1) (util-linux-misc: the owner types the organisation root's
# passphrase, scripts/lib/org.sh). The released nfltr and nfltr-relay and
# the example's static linux builds, mounted at /opt/dg.
